<view class="page bind">
  <view class="bind__head">
    <view class="h1">绑定你的账号</view>
    <view class="muted mt-8">绑定后，这台微信下次打开就能直接进入，不用再输密码。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field__label">我是</view>
      <view class="roles">
        <view
          class="role {{role === item.value ? 'role--on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{roles}}"
          wx:key="value"
          data-role="{{item.value}}"
          bindtap="onRoleTap"
        >
          {{item.label}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field__label">账号</view>
      <input
        class="field__input"
        type="text"
        value="{{username}}"
        placeholder="老师发给你的账号"
        placeholder-class="field__placeholder"
        bindinput="onUsernameInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field field--last">
      <view class="field__label">密码</view>
      <input
        class="field__input"
        password
        value="{{password}}"
        placeholder="初始密码可以问老师"
        placeholder-class="field__placeholder"
        bindinput="onPasswordInput"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="bind__error" wx:if="{{error}}">
    <view class="bind__error-text">{{error}}</view>
    <view class="tiny mt-8" wx:if="{{conflict}}">这个微信已经绑定过其他账号了。请让老师帮忙解绑，或先用原来的账号登录后在「我的」里解绑。</view>
    <view class="tiny mt-8" wx:else>如果密码记不清了，请联系老师重置；连续输错后可以返回登录页重新开始。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn btn--primary btn--block {{busy ? 'btn--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
    {{busy ? '正在绑定…' : '绑定并进入'}}
  </view>

  <view class="bind__back" bindtap="onBackToLogin">返回登录</view>
</view>
